5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we agree! Let's check the offshore house prices and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m checking ferry times and how last year’s days actually ran. I refuse to lose another week to transit and waiting.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know how money was split last time and what separate rooms cost. I will check those two.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I’m checking bathing hours and bathroom provision, plus inn mealtimes and room arrangements. I need to know where I wash and when I eat.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the ferry takes two days, that’s terrible! I want to know the exact total cost so I’m not surprised later.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I’m not surprised by the cost, I’m tired of the commute. If the ferry eats two days, I’m out.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the commute is a logistical problem. I am focused on the financial ambiguity. We need clear rules before we commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, if the ferry eats two days, I’m out too. I need to know the bath and meal times before I agree to anything.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, I am also watching the transit. But I am more concerned about how the group dynamic shifts when we are forced together versus apart.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I get that! But if the bill is a mystery, I can’t enjoy the adventure. I need the numbers first!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the numbers are secondary. If the travel time is excessive, the destination is irrelevant. I am prioritizing the logistics.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the numbers are only useful if the structure is sound. I am checking the cost variance to ensure the division is fair, not just the total.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, fair division is fine, but I need a bathroom that works and a chair that isn’t a bed. I’m checking the inn details now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the physical comfort is valid. But I am trying to understand why the group feels disconnected despite being together.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I get it! But I need the total price before I can worry about feelings. Let’s just pick a place and stop guessing!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, feelings are the only thing that makes the trip worth the cost. I am done.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, feelings are not the only thing. I am done.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I’m done. I just need to know if I can sleep without counting the days.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am done. The structure of the week determines the quality of our time together.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
