35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found the island house is 5,400 yen a head a night, but food is extra! That’s not a total cost. I hate surprises!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Ninety minutes by train. That is acceptable. The ferry is a two-day waste. I am done.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The separate rooms varied by eight thousand yen. A whole house is one bill. That is the only fair structure.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"One bathroom for the whole island house, and the water runs cold. That is a dealbreaker. I need a private door and a working bath.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The house year left me with nowhere to go. Last year, we barely met. I need a place where we can be together, but also apart.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, one bill is great! But if food is extra, I still don’t know the total. I need to know exactly what I’m paying before I say yes!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is ninety minutes. The ferry is two days. I am not wasting my holiday on a boat.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the all-in rate is a fixed cost. You pay the same as the biggest eater, but the total is known. That is the certainty you want.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, the all-in rate means I pay for food I don’t eat. I need a door and a chair, not a fixed bill.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, a town with streets and a public bath solves the isolation. We can be together, yet apart.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, but I eat less than the others! Paying the same is unfair. I want to know the exact total, not just a flat rate!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is ninety minutes. The ferry is two days. I am not wasting my holiday on a boat.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, fairness is not identical payment. It is a transparent structure. The all-in rate eliminates the eight thousand yen variance I found.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, a public bath is fine, but I need a private room with a door. I refuse to sleep on a futon in a shared space.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, a private door is a boundary, not a wall. The town allows us to drift apart and return without resentment.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I still don't know the food cost! I need the exact total before I commit. No more guessing!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is ninety minutes. The ferry is two days. I am not wasting my holiday on a boat.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the variance is the problem. A single bill divides evenly. That is the structural fairness I am proposing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I don't care about the food cost if I can't sleep. I need a private room with a door.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the structure is the certainty. A town lets us share the day without forcing it. I am done.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
